            <ArticleTitle>[Pure internal subtalar dislocation: about a case].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>123</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.11604/pamj.2017.27.123.12173</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pure subtalar dislocation is a rare condition. We here report the case of a young patient presenting with pure internal subtalar dislocation as a result of a sport accident. He underwent orthopedic therapy achieving a good functional outcome.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
